Ward against beings associated with Animal from one supernatural realm (Divine, Faerie, Infernal, or Magic) with Might less than or equal to the level of the spell. (Touch, Ring, Circle) **Level 5:** Ward against animals or objects

made from animal products. (Touch, Ring, Circle)

